Sonara is a rebrand of the TikTok TTS integration for Home Assistant:
  - Original integration by Philipp Lüttecke
    https://github.com/philipp-luettecke/tiktoktts (MIT, notice above)
  - Extended fork by Steven Fox (@sfox38), https://github.com/sfox38/tiktoktts
  - Community TTS proxy by Weilbyte, https://github.com/Weilbyte/tiktok-tts
  - Voice list reference by oscie57, https://github.com/oscie57/tiktok-voice
